  "researchNotes": "Official US site (cartier.com/en-us) High Perfumery listing read: 23 fragrances, each with concentration. Product pages read for perfumer (Mathilde Laurent on all), olfactory family and, where stated, accords and collection. Product pages show only an INCI ingredient list, not a notes pyramid, so no notes are recorded (noteSource null). Launch years are not stated on the pages. Discovery set excluded. Signature lines: Baiser Volé, Santos de Cartier, Déclaration, Must de Cartier and La Panthère added from Olfastory composition pages (reported notes; Must's page gives two conflicting pyramids, the Michael Edwards one is recorded). Pasha de Cartier not added: notino and the other retailer pages were not readable, so its notes could not be verified. The US High Perfumery listing and its product pages were read via WebFetch without blocking. VI L'Heure Brillante product page title reads 'Lemon Eau de Toilette'; family taken from that page, name from the listing.",
